    "overview": "Intex GlideX Glow Dry Iron (1000W) Experience effortless ironing with the Intex GlideX Glow Dry Iron (1000W) , designed for convenience, safety, and performance. Featuring a unique colour-changing indicator , this iron lets you easily know when it’s ready to use, ensuring hassle-free operation every time. Powered by 1000 watts , it delivers quick heating and smooth ironing results. The adjustable thermostat and multiple temperature settings allow precise control for different fabric types, from delicate clothes to heavy garments. Built with a shock-proof body and auto cut-off feature , GlideX Glow prioritizes safety while delivering consistent performance. The 360° swivel cord provides flexibility and ease of movement, making your ironing experience comfortable and efficient. Perfect for daily home use, this iron combines smart features with reliable performance.",
